01:49:43.333 --> 01:49:44.333
Lucu banget.

01:49:54.000 --> 01:49:57.233
Cengkeramanmu makin kuat ya.

01:49:57.366 --> 01:49:57.733
Jangan keluar.

01:49:58.300 --> 01:49:59.300
Keluar sana, pecundang.

01:50:00.433 --> 01:50:01.600
Kamu kan masokis, pecundang.

01:50:02.433 --> 01:50:03.433
Kontol.

01:50:03.733 --> 01:50:04.733
Keluar.

01:50:59.733 --> 01:51:01.000
Kamu lagi makan apa?

01:51:02.033 --> 01:51:03.033
Kanna-chan.

01:51:07.500 --> 01:51:08.500
Kenapa?

01:51:33.933 --> 01:51:52.700
Beda sama di toko. Nggak ada teh di sini. Mau minum?

01:51:53.933 --> 01:51:54.933
Ini?

01:51:58.100 --> 01:52:04.866
Jilat sendiri cairanmu yang basah itu sampai bersih.

01:52:11.100 --> 01:52:12.200
Cepat jilat.

01:52:35.366 --> 01:52:36.500
Kamu makin jago ya.

01:52:46.700 --> 01:52:49.033
Menjauhlah.

01:53:12.166 --> 01:53:13.233
Cepat juga ya.

01:53:13.733 --> 01:53:14.733
Kukasih hadiah nih.

01:53:15.600 --> 01:53:16.600
Sini lu.

01:53:31.966 --> 01:53:36.866
