01:53:44.766 --> 01:53:46.300
Dia bawa kabur orangnya.

01:54:09.166 --> 01:54:11.700
Emang bener-bener si Toyamazaka Chinpa.

01:54:12.400 --> 01:54:14.300
Gak bisa kering-kering ya meski udah berkali-kali?

01:54:15.800 --> 01:54:17.866
