02:00:34.033 --> 02:00:35.033
Hebat.

02:00:51.033 --> 02:00:52.033
Cupu.

02:00:53.133 --> 02:00:54.466
Mulut gue.

02:00:55.700 --> 02:00:57.533
Selalu gue masukin kok.

02:01:00.966 --> 02:01:01.966
Hebat.

02:01:19.033 --> 02:01:21.966
Lu cium sendiri kan air seni lu?

02:01:26.533 --> 02:01:29.000
Masih panjang, sampe jam operasional besok.

02:01:39.033 --> 02:01:40.366
Ini baru permulaan neraka.

02:01:46.333 --> 02:01:50.800
Yah, mungkin bagimu ini memang surga.
